> 
> Give the stage-2 walk similar treatment to stage-1: update the access
> flag during the table walk and do so for any walk context.
> 
> Signed-off-by: Oliver Upton <oupton@kernel.org>
> ---
>  arch/arm64/kvm/mmu.c    |  3 +++
